"The Order of the Night King sealed Renir in an amber gem while he was drunk."
"He had found the Order corrupting monsters on purpose; that is why they took him."
"His own wards stop them killing him, so they sealed him instead; the seals slowly drain him."
"He suspects a Pillar helped seal him, most likely Merlin."
"The gem bears nine seals; two are broken and seven remain."
"A Pulse Stone broke the first seal; a resonance crystal charged at four nodes broke the second."
"The third seal needs a Navaterian ritual with a sand orchid as its catalyst."
"The gem is now apple-sized, with crystal arms and legs and a glowing face; he can waddle."
"From the gem he casts small spells: fire, lightning, ice spears, a water shield, and light."
"He cannot eat, drink, sleep or breathe; he senses warmth and cold but little else."
"He can no longer enter Liora's Inventory, so Order mages can track him."
"He gave Liora the System, and she carries him in a web pouch at her neck."
"To merfolk and antkin he claims to be a birdkin of phoenix blood, Liora's mate, cursed to a gem."
"He has fallen for Liora and admits to himself that he cares for her."
"His mother died years ago; Aenir chose to sacrifice her to save Renir."
"Renir has buried the memory of that day and never forgave Aenir."
"He feels Aenir was always everyone's first choice."
"Now he is in the antkin anthill's mage chamber, deciphering the Navaterian tome with mage ants."
"He has learned the sand orchid now grows only in the human desert kingdom."
"He quarreled with Liora over Aenir and called her stupid; he wants to apologize but fears to."
